http-parser (http-parser/): nodejs/http-parser v2.9.4, its last release
(the repository is archived), unmodified:
Git URL=https://github.com/nodejs/http-parser
Git tag=v2.9.4 (2343fd6b5214b2ded2cdcf76de2bf60903bb90cd)
It replaces the 2.5.0 copy that came with qhttpserver, whose fixes since include
the rejection of interior blanks in Content-Length (CVE-2018-7159), of empty
and duplicate Content-Length values, the Transfer-Encoding handling of
CVE-2019-15605, and out-of-bounds reads in http_parser_parse_url().
The QHttpRequest::HttpMethod enum mirrors its HTTP_METHOD_MAP (checked by a
static_assert in src/qhttpconnection.cpp).
